ent/uploads/2015/12/flint_knapping.jpg\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-3922\" src=\"//web.archive.org/web/2im_/http://www.radia.fm/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/flint_knapping-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"flint_knapping\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" style=\"background:transparent;border:none;margin:4px 24px 12px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;float:left;height:auto;\" /></a></p><blockquote style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px 3em;vertical-align:baseline;font-style:italic;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\"><p class=\"western\" lang=\"en-us\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">“What we’ve learn’t and what we’ve found,</p><p class=\"western\" lang=\"en-us\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">What we know and what we are,</p><p class=\"western\" lang=\"en-us\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">And where we’re from</p><p class=\"western\" lang=\"en-us\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">….you can hear what it’s made of.”</p></blockquote><p class=\"western\" lang=\"en-us\" style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\" xml:lang=\"en-us\">Alice Armstrong & Ben Fielding.</p>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"36","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Soundart Radio","title":"Show 0558: “The Curiosity Overcomes You” by Alice Armstrong (Soundart Radio)","publicdate":"2017-05-06 15:28:37","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-05-06 15:28:37","date":"2015-12-07","creator":"Soundart Radio","backup_location":"ia906403_22"},"server":"ia800101.us.archive.org","uniq":242461853,"workable_servers":["ia800101.us.archive.org","ia600101.us.archive.org"]}